WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Advertise your product or brand here
contact www.OpenSubtitles.org today

2
00:01:01.104 --> 00:01:03.976
You managed to get most of it
on the paper this time.

3
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.936
Good job. buddy.

4
00:01:08.372 --> 00:01:09.808
Okay.

5
00:01:10.548 --> 00:01:11.767
<i>Hey. hey. it's me.</i>

6
00:01:12.724 --> 00:01:14.335
<i>Happy birthday week.</i>

7
00:01:14.509 --> 00:01:16.119
<i>So. I expect
you're celebrating.</i>

8
00:01:16.293 --> 00:01:17.860
<i>When do you think
you're coming back?</i>

9
00:01:18.034 --> 00:01:19.122
<i>Let me know. 'Cause. well.
you know. we miss you.</i>

10
00:01:19.296 --> 00:01:20.080
<i>Okay. don't have too much--</i>

11
00:01:47.063 --> 00:01:49.500
I need a yellow sun. like. now.

12
00:03:10.842 --> 00:03:11.800
Brigands.

13
00:03:13.367 --> 00:03:14.846
They've come for my swords.

14
00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.587
I guess it was only
a matter of time.

15
00:03:17.066 --> 00:03:18.372
We give them what they want...

16
00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.636
and then they'll leave.

17
00:04:06.376 --> 00:04:07.377
Mm?

18
00:04:09.814 --> 00:04:10.902
Is that pie?

19
00:04:13.731 --> 00:04:14.689
Yes.

20
00:04:42.369 --> 00:04:43.761
I know who you are.

21
00:04:45.937 --> 00:04:47.504
Krem of the Yellow Hills.

22
00:04:48.157 --> 00:04:49.767
Then you know why I'm here.

23
00:04:49.941 --> 00:04:51.203
My life's work.

24
00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:53.641
All in the shed out back.

25
00:04:53.815 --> 00:04:55.033
Handcrafted weapons

26
00:04:55.207 --> 00:04:56.426
forged from
the strongest steel

27
00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.819
that you or your Brigand army

28
00:04:57.993 --> 00:04:59.777
will ever lay
your filthy eyes on.

29
00:04:59.951 --> 00:05:02.389
You have what you want.
Now leave.

30
00:05:15.793 --> 00:05:16.707
Show me the way.

31
00:05:17.882 --> 00:05:19.144
Not you.

32
00:05:21.103 --> 00:05:22.496
Her.

33
00:05:31.983 --> 00:05:33.724
No!

34
00:05:55.311 --> 00:05:57.052
Mm-hmm.

35
00:06:37.484 --> 00:06:41.009
I. Kara Zor-El.

36
00:06:41.183 --> 00:06:46.101
of inebriated mind. body.

37
00:06:46.275 --> 00:06:48.408
and. uh... spirit...

38
00:06:48.582 --> 00:06:50.975
I hereby declare...

39
00:06:52.977 --> 00:06:55.153
that 23 will be
the best year yet.

40
00:06:55.763 --> 00:06:56.938
But let's be honest. babe.

41
00:06:57.112 --> 00:06:59.114
it's not a very high bar
to clear.

42
00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.164
Okay...

43
00:07:07.818 --> 00:07:09.167
Should we just move here?

44
00:07:09.341 --> 00:07:11.822
Maybe we're meant to be
red sun folks. you know?

45
00:07:11.996 --> 00:07:15.870
The kinds who feel things like
a punch in the face

46
00:07:16.044 --> 00:07:18.394
and. like. shots of. like.
whatever this is.

47
00:07:20.483 --> 00:07:21.745
It's really good. you know?

48
00:07:24.574 --> 00:07:25.619
Maybe this is home.

49
00:07:53.734 --> 00:07:54.691
Not gonna happen.

50
00:08:14.755 --> 00:08:15.669
Attention.

51
00:08:17.932 --> 00:08:19.150
Attention!

52
00:08:24.634 --> 00:08:26.027
Seriously?

53
00:08:26.201 --> 00:08:28.464
I am Ruthye Marye Knoll
of the Danastia Clan.

54
00:08:28.725 --> 00:08:30.248
And I come here
with one purpose.

55
00:08:30.422 --> 00:08:31.946
Man.

56
00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.513
To seek revenge against
Krem of the Yellow Hills...

57
00:08:35.384 --> 00:08:36.777
...a Brigand who has
trespassed onto our planet.

58
00:08:36.951 --> 00:08:38.779
murdered my innocent
and honorable family

59
00:08:38.953 --> 00:08:40.781
- in cold blood.
- Rough.

60
00:08:40.955 --> 00:08:42.957
Krem's ship was destroyed.
and I believe

61
00:08:43.131 --> 00:08:44.654
he's still searching for
a passage off our planet.

62
00:08:44.828 --> 00:08:46.482
I will need a skilled tracker.

63
00:08:46.656 --> 00:08:48.092
who can help me locate
this monster

64
00:08:48.266 --> 00:08:50.573
- before he escapes.
- Dude. no.

65
00:08:50.747 --> 00:08:53.489
I don't-- I don't have
my powers here. all right?

66
00:08:53.663 --> 00:08:55.186
- I will do the rest...
- Not my monkeys.

67
00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.710
Not my circus.

68
00:08:56.884 --> 00:08:58.102
...ending his life
to avenge my family.

69
00:09:01.236 --> 00:09:02.367
In exchange...

70
00:09:04.369 --> 00:09:05.936
I offer you my family sword.

71
00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.244
Made by the hands
of my father. Elias Knoll.

72
00:09:10.724 --> 00:09:12.116
The blade will be
provided to you

73
00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:13.770
after I use it
to take Krem's life.

74
00:09:16.338 --> 00:09:17.731
It's not our problem.

75
00:09:17.905 --> 00:09:20.298
- Elias Knoll. you say?
- Yes.

76
00:09:22.474 --> 00:09:24.912
A child of your size expects
to wield such a weapon?

77
00:09:25.086 --> 00:09:26.391
I am no child.

78
00:09:26.566 --> 00:09:28.393
I had my thirteenth turn
this past harvest.

79
00:09:28.568 --> 00:09:30.787
Ah. but taking on a Brigand?

80
00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.095
- Impossible.
- Oh. that might be a problem.

81
00:09:34.269 --> 00:09:37.141
You will need someone of
enormous power to defeat Krem.

82
00:09:37.751 --> 00:09:38.752
I shall do the job myself.

83
00:09:45.846 --> 00:09:49.719
Hey!

84
00:09:51.242 --> 00:09:52.809
Mm-mm.

85
00:09:52.983 --> 00:09:55.290
Hold this. All right. just...
Let me talk to him.

86
00:09:59.686 --> 00:10:01.905
It's not too late.

87
00:10:03.907 --> 00:10:06.649
Let's not... be a jerk.

88
00:10:07.215 --> 00:10:09.173
Just... Just give me back
the sword-- Whoa.

89
00:10:11.175 --> 00:10:12.699
...and we can move on.

90
00:10:12.873 --> 00:10:14.918
You don't steal
from a little kid

91
00:10:15.092 --> 00:10:17.138
who just lost her parents.
Like. that's--

92
00:10:17.704 --> 00:10:19.488
Man. that's so clearly
over the line

93
00:10:19.662 --> 00:10:21.142
of acceptable behavior.

94
00:10:25.102 --> 00:10:27.017
You could at least
help her find the...

95
00:10:27.888 --> 00:10:29.063
God.

96
00:10:29.237 --> 00:10:30.804
...find the shithead
who killed them.

97
00:10:30.978 --> 00:10:31.935
and then you can get
the sword.

98
00:10:32.109 --> 00:10:33.154
like. fair and square.

99
00:10:35.243 --> 00:10:37.027
Oh. you think
I'm talking too much?

100
00:10:37.201 --> 00:10:38.202
No problem.

101
00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.335
I can talk less.

102
00:10:47.603 --> 00:10:49.213
Okay. that was...
that was less talking.

103
00:10:50.214 --> 00:10:51.346
How do you like that?

104
00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.826
Oh. God! There it is. Wow.

105
00:10:53.217 --> 00:10:55.045
Okay.

106
00:10:55.219 --> 00:10:56.960
It's actually. like. a really
beautiful piece of silverware.

107
00:11:05.403 --> 00:11:07.231
Hey. look. I'm bleeding.

108
00:11:08.232 --> 00:11:09.103
Whoa!

109
00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:11.932
Whoa. what the fu--?

110
00:11:14.151 --> 00:11:16.240
Oh. you're an angry fella.
aren't you?

111
00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.650
Easy. Okay. Okay!
Give me a second.

112
00:11:34.824 --> 00:11:35.695
I'm a little...
I'm a little winded.

113
00:11:36.739 --> 00:11:37.871
No. no. no. no. no.

114
00:11:39.873 --> 00:11:40.743
Argh!

115
00:11:55.889 --> 00:11:57.064
Whew.

116
00:12:11.121 --> 00:12:12.383
Believe this is yours.

117
00:12:16.866 --> 00:12:17.737
Thank you.

118
00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:21.871
I need to go to bed.

119
00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.187
Stop. Stop.

120
00:12:48.202 --> 00:12:49.116
Oh.

121
00:12:50.508 --> 00:12:51.466
Um...

122
00:12:57.472 --> 00:12:58.516
Ow!

123
00:12:59.082 --> 00:13:01.476
Oh...

124
00:13:03.304 --> 00:13:04.218
Ugh.

125
00:13:18.145 --> 00:13:19.668
<i>Hi! Hi. Finally got you.</i>

126
00:13:19.842 --> 00:13:22.279
Mm-hmm. It's my lucky day!

127
00:13:22.453 --> 00:13:24.281
<i>Still. uh...
still celebrating. huh?</i>

128
00:13:24.455 --> 00:13:26.109
Yeah. What do you want?

129
00:13:26.283 --> 00:13:28.633
<i>I was just... Just wanted
to touch base about</i>

130
00:13:28.808 --> 00:13:29.809
<i>when you think
you might be coming back.</i>

131
00:13:30.505 --> 00:13:31.593
No idea.

132
00:13:31.767 --> 00:13:33.334
<i>Kara. I'm just worried that...</i>

133
00:13:33.508 --> 00:13:35.205
<i>if you keep going off-planet
like this.</i>

134
00:13:35.379 --> 00:13:36.380
<i>you're never gonna find
your stride here.</i>

135
00:13:36.554 --> 00:13:37.686
<i>in Metropolis.</i>

136
00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.470
Hold on.

137
00:13:39.644 --> 00:13:40.950
<i>I'm worried you might never
find your people.</i>

138
00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:45.737
Mm. That's the thing. Clark.
I have no people.

139
00:13:46.521 --> 00:13:48.262
<i>I know that.</i>

140
00:13:48.436 --> 00:13:50.133
<i>I just mean maybe if you spent
a little more time here.</i>

141
00:13:50.307 --> 00:13:52.005
<i>you might feel more at home.</i>

142
00:13:52.179 --> 00:13:54.834
Hold on! Uh. I gotta go.

143
00:13:55.008 --> 00:13:56.574
<i>Okay. Just. um. give me a call
and let me know--</i>

144
00:13:56.748 --> 00:13:57.880
Good talk. Bye.

145
00:13:59.534 --> 00:14:00.578
Hold on!

146
00:14:03.451 --> 00:14:05.366
I am Ruthye Marye Knoll
of the Danastia Clan.

147
00:14:06.236 --> 00:14:07.498
And I come here
to seek revenge--

148
00:14:07.672 --> 00:14:09.370
Yeah. some guy named Cream.
Yeah.

149
00:14:09.544 --> 00:14:11.198
You already hit me
with this pitch.

150
00:14:11.372 --> 00:14:13.243
So. what. you're going...

151
00:14:14.854 --> 00:14:16.507
You're door-to-door now?

152
00:14:16.681 --> 00:14:19.423
Look. I would love
to help you. but I can't.

153
00:14:19.597 --> 00:14:21.773
So. onto the next door
with you.

154
00:14:23.645 --> 00:14:26.126
Now. if you'll excuse me.
I really need to pee.

155
00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.649
Okay.

156
00:14:42.882 --> 00:14:44.187
- Was your ship attacked?
- Oh. my God.

157
00:14:46.537 --> 00:14:48.365
Wait! Please!

158
00:14:49.236 --> 00:14:51.412
Look. last night you stood up
for the righteous.

159
00:14:51.586 --> 00:14:52.848
The just.

160
00:14:53.022 --> 00:14:54.197
Look...

161
00:14:55.024 --> 00:14:56.460
If you think I'm gonna
lead you on the mountains

162
00:14:56.634 --> 00:14:59.376
through some sort of...
revenge plot.

163
00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:03.032
turning you into
a psychotic... child murderer.

164
00:15:03.206 --> 00:15:05.905
then you must be. as they say.
"on glue."

165
00:15:07.602 --> 00:15:09.299
Ew.

166
00:15:24.445 --> 00:15:26.926
Shall we take Elias' daughter?

167
00:15:27.535 --> 00:15:29.754
The cells are packed solid.
aren't they?

168
00:15:33.149 --> 00:15:35.325
What do you think
of my new ship?

169
00:15:39.155 --> 00:15:40.330
Come on. man.

170
00:15:40.504 --> 00:15:42.419
We gotta be
back up in the sky ASAP.

171
00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:44.117
Krem deserves
what is coming to him.

172
00:15:46.119 --> 00:15:48.034
You go round driven by "deserve"
and you'll end up...

173
00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:49.818
very unhappy.

174
00:16:01.569 --> 00:16:03.266
Krypto!

175
00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.094
- Krem. That's him.
- What the--? Hey!

176
00:16:05.268 --> 00:16:06.269
They're taking your ship
off the planet.

177
00:16:07.444 --> 00:16:08.576
Krypto!

178
00:16:12.362 --> 00:16:13.973
No! Krypto!

179
00:16:15.017 --> 00:16:15.975
No!

180
00:16:27.812 --> 00:16:29.640
Hey. Hey. buddy.

181
00:16:30.554 --> 00:16:32.382
It's gonna be okay. Okay?

182
00:16:52.141 --> 00:16:53.403
A Brigandian toxin

183
00:16:53.577 --> 00:16:54.883
known as Reddimeir.

184
00:16:55.057 --> 00:16:57.364
She says it paralyzes
the host slowly.

185
00:16:57.538 --> 00:16:59.148
and I'm sorry. but painfully.

186
00:16:59.322 --> 00:17:00.497
before eventually...

187
00:17:01.542 --> 00:17:02.412
stopping the heart.

188
00:17:04.023 --> 00:17:05.328
What can I do?

189
00:17:08.027 --> 00:17:08.984
What? What is it?

190
00:17:10.942 --> 00:17:12.118
She says it's more difficult

191
00:17:12.292 --> 00:17:14.033
since Krem escaped
off the planet.

192
00:17:14.207 --> 00:17:16.165
Moving him
would risk accelerating

193
00:17:16.339 --> 00:17:17.862
the effects of the toxin.

194
00:17:18.559 --> 00:17:20.126
The Brigands carry
the antidote on their person.

195
00:17:23.129 --> 00:17:25.870
They use it
as an interrogation tactic.

196
00:17:26.045 --> 00:17:28.525
Dangling relief
in exchange for money.

197
00:17:29.135 --> 00:17:31.789
information.
whatever they're after.

198
00:17:36.229 --> 00:17:37.099
Without the antidote

199
00:17:37.273 --> 00:17:38.361
there's nothing she can do.

200
00:17:39.928 --> 00:17:41.103
How long does he have?

201
00:17:43.323 --> 00:17:44.498
Three moon raises.

202
00:17:46.239 --> 00:17:48.458
Okay. Three days.

203
00:17:50.591 --> 00:17:53.855
Hey. Hey.
I'm gonna go now.

204
00:17:57.946 --> 00:18:00.905
And you-- You cannot
freaking give up on me.

205
00:18:02.994 --> 00:18:04.431
Home is
wherever you are. buddy.

206
00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:19.010
Are you going after Krem
for the antidote?

207
00:18:19.924 --> 00:18:21.012
You could help me.

208
00:18:21.187 --> 00:18:22.666
No. we could help each other.

209
00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.974
You for the antidote.
and me to kill him.

210
00:18:27.106 --> 00:18:30.065
Look. I'm... I'm sorry...

211
00:18:30.761 --> 00:18:31.849
about what happened
to your family.

212
00:18:32.023 --> 00:18:33.677
Okay? I am. So he'll suffer.

213
00:18:33.851 --> 00:18:35.592
Suffer?
No. he needs to be killed.

214
00:18:35.766 --> 00:18:37.464
Ruthye. your revenge
is not going to get in the way

215
00:18:37.638 --> 00:18:38.900
of me saving my dog.

216
00:18:40.945 --> 00:18:43.165
Okay. just... like. just
stay here and look after him.

217
00:18:59.181 --> 00:19:00.139
Okay.

218
00:19:01.227 --> 00:19:02.576
One...

219
00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:03.881
Two...

220
00:19:04.621 --> 00:19:06.884
Three... moon raises.

221
00:19:08.625 --> 00:19:11.193
72 hours. buddy.

222
00:19:29.385 --> 00:19:30.778
Who are you?

223
00:20:01.112 --> 00:20:01.983
He basically
said. "Welcome aboard.

224
00:20:02.157 --> 00:20:03.114
Please watch your step."

225
00:20:03.289 --> 00:20:05.291
Yeah. sure he did.

226
00:20:32.056 --> 00:20:32.970
Gum?

227
00:20:40.369 --> 00:20:43.590
Maybe give us all a break
from that hookah thingy.

228
00:20:45.679 --> 00:20:46.767
Okay.

229
00:20:47.637 --> 00:20:49.596
Comfy?

230
00:20:52.425 --> 00:20:53.339
You got a clue
what I'm saying?

231
00:20:54.905 --> 00:20:56.603
Do I look like an idiot
to you?

232
00:20:58.126 --> 00:20:59.736
Debatable.

233
00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:01.303
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

234
00:21:01.477 --> 00:21:02.826
I was just trying
to get through to my seat.

235
00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.915
- It was an accident.
- Oh. freakin' Ruthye.

236
00:21:11.008 --> 00:21:12.227
Ow.

237
00:21:21.541 --> 00:21:23.064
You put your bag on the floor
at her feet.

238
00:21:23.238 --> 00:21:25.414
which is calling her mother
a whore.

239
00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:29.113
Okay. why aren't you
with Krypto?

240
00:21:29.288 --> 00:21:30.898
I'm searching for Krem myself.

241
00:21:31.072 --> 00:21:34.728
I think I was pretty clear
when I said no to that plan.

242
00:21:36.469 --> 00:21:37.687
Excuse me. can you move over

243
00:21:37.861 --> 00:21:39.036
so I can sit
next to my friend?

244
00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:41.300
Oh. your friend. Absolutely.

245
00:21:41.474 --> 00:21:42.475
She's not my fr...
You're not my friend.

246
00:21:42.649 --> 00:21:43.563
Yes. I am.

247
00:21:45.608 --> 00:21:46.566
Okay.

248
00:21:48.307 --> 00:21:50.613
- What's my name?
- What?

249
00:21:52.963 --> 00:21:55.052
What did you hit now. Lloyd?

250
00:22:11.982 --> 00:22:12.809
Who are they?

251
00:22:12.983 --> 00:22:13.941
What do they want?

252
00:22:14.115 --> 00:22:15.508
Sklarian Raiders.

253
00:22:15.682 --> 00:22:17.423
They're like tech pirates.

254
00:22:18.249 --> 00:22:19.816
They want the bus.
they want the fuel.

255
00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:21.340
they want the engine.

256
00:22:21.514 --> 00:22:23.167
Look away. Lloyd.
Look away. Look away.

257
00:22:23.994 --> 00:22:25.953
My guess is they want
to rob us all blind first.

258
00:22:51.108 --> 00:22:52.675
Noted.

259
00:22:52.849 --> 00:22:54.373
I knew I should have
called in sick today. Lloyd.

260
00:23:00.683 --> 00:23:01.205
The watch.

261
00:23:21.965 --> 00:23:24.054
No. she doesn't--
You know. she doesn't--

262
00:23:24.228 --> 00:23:25.926
Ruthye. Ruthye. let go.

263
00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:28.972
Ruthye. let go. Let go.

264
