He's my cousin.

367
00:33:14.993 --> 00:33:16.516
And you are Superwoman?

368
00:33:16.690 --> 00:33:18.300
I'm Supergirl.

369
00:33:19.127 --> 00:33:21.260
Are you considerably younger
than he is?

370
00:33:21.434 --> 00:33:24.350
There's. like.
ten years. give or take.

371
00:33:24.524 --> 00:33:26.308
How come he's a man?
I mean. you're--

372
00:33:26.482 --> 00:33:27.831
Move it! Out of the way.

373
00:33:32.140 --> 00:33:33.489
Let's find some Brigands.

374
