Oh. you don't have to.

423
00:37:04.439 --> 00:37:05.962
No. no. no. no.
It's good. It's good.

424
00:37:06.136 --> 00:37:07.529
Oh. I didn't know that
you spoke the Common Tongue.

425
00:37:07.703 --> 00:37:08.574
Little.

426
00:37:14.362 --> 00:37:15.842
- Mareck.
- Mar... Mareck.

427
00:37:16.495 --> 00:37:18.018
Bomar.

428
00:37:18.192 --> 00:37:20.977
Well. we're actually here
looking for somebody.

429
00:37:21.151 --> 00:37:23.589
You don't happen to know
any Brigands? Do you?

430
00:37:35.122 --> 00:37:36.036
Shit.

431
00:37:37.385 --> 00:37:38.256
It's Lobo.

432
00:37:43.043 --> 00:37:44.044
- Who?
- Keep quiet.

433
00:37:44.218 --> 00:37:45.698
No eye contact.

434
00:37:48.962 --> 00:37:50.616
He's an immortal
with a God complex.

435
00:37:50.790 --> 00:37:52.618
Killed off his entire planet.

436
00:37:52.792 --> 00:37:54.315
Not a fun guy. Hey.

437
00:37:56.622 --> 00:37:58.798
Three more of whatever
you call that shit.

438
00:38:00.452 --> 00:38:01.670
I'm looking for a Brigand.

439
00:38:01.844 --> 00:38:03.585
Goes by the name
of Drom Baxton.

440
00:38:03.759 --> 00:38:04.934
He's an ugly friggin' bastich.

441
00:38:05.108 --> 00:38:06.675
- He's looking for Brigands.
